It's a pretty nice game with an amazing story, it became fast enough one of my favorite games.
Pros:
-An amazing atmosphere, you'll look everywhere even while watching TV or listening to radio;
-A masterpiece of soundtrack, you'll fall in love with it very fast;
-The story... the story is simply magnificent, even tho' sometimes it likes its metaphors a little too much and other times you feel that it just want to make the game longer, but it will keep you with your face glued to monitor carving for more;
-The combat isn't what you would call amazing, but it's there and it has moments when it's good, but too repetitive in my opinion. The special 1&2 bring some good changes that make it a little less insupportable and maybe even good.. maybe.
-Every problem I have with the mechanics in the game are resolved in the special episodes proving that the game can be pretty close to perfect for me.
Cons:
-The faces... just don't ask... (if you played Mass Effect Andromeda you'll be ok)
-The driving, if there is a part that you'll hate the most it's the drive section. You'll feel like it's winter and everywhere is ice and you drinked like you had free vodka for a year, but you decided to take it all in one day. The good part is that the driving section are sort and just 4-5 in total;
-The watering cans man, I tell you that they are the real villan of the game.
-The final section and boss of special 2 is everything that the final boss in episode 6 should've been;
Even if it has some flaws it's an amazing game that you should play if you want a good story and a new favorite band
9/10- not enough watering cans
